	<section_number>15.2-5316</section_number>
	<catch_line>Removed commissioner may appeal</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any commissioner thus removed may, within ten days after the mayor's action, appeal to the circuit court of the city, and the decision of such court shall be final.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 32-230; 1979, c. 719, § 15.1-1549; 1997, c. 587.</history>
